# The Figma Make export ships its own CLAUDE.md (it just imports its AGENTS.md).
# The folder is reference material we build *from*, not a project we build *in*,
# and those instructions describe vite/pnpm/Figma deploys, which contradict this
# repo's. Keep the file on disk, out of the repo, so it never becomes live
# instructions for anyone working here.
Design bathroom rating app/CLAUDE.md
Design bathroom rating app/AGENTS.md
